    "gitCommitMessage": "feat: Add Contacts Onboarding Card and related hooks\n\n- Implemented ContactsOnboardingCard component for managing contacts access onboarding with multiple variants (prominent, compact, limited, denied).\n- Created useContactsOnboarding hook to manage permission status, card visibility, and async storage for dismissal persistence.\n- Introduced useTasksSummary hook for tracking daily and monthly task progress counts.\n- Developed threadIdentityWarmup service for prefetching identity images and decorations for chat threads.\n- Added streamPushRegistration service for registering and unregistering device push tokens with Stream Video.\n- Implemented centralized chat timestamp formatting utility for consistent timestamp display across chat UI.\n- Created remoteImageSource utility for normalizing and building remote image sources.",
